<rml>
<head>
	<title>Options</title>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="base.rcss"/>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="option_window.rcss"/>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="weather_options.rcss"/>
	<link type="text/template" href="window_shell.rml"/>
</head>
<!-- The legacy theme's settings window. The modern theme has its own full-screen markup at
     themes/modern/option_window.rml, on the same data model and events; keep the two in step
     when a setting is added.

     Every row uses the same two-column shape (label, then control), .option-row-label first in
     each row's own markup order -- including the checkbox rows, which put the label BEFORE
     .checkbox-box rather than using base.rcss's own .checkbox-label (position:absolute, glyph-
     first, built for login.rml's standalone checkboxes). That convention doesn't line up with a
     column of sibling rows: every label needs to start at the same x position a settings menu's
     scannable label column requires, which only a shared in-flow .option-row-label achieves. Left-
     justified throughout (no justify-content:center, unlike generic_menu_dialog's own centered
     .gmd-button-row) -- centering would misalign the label column across rows whose controls have
     different widths.

     Frame/border/header/positioning/dragging all live in window_shell.rml -- this document
     supplies only its own content, spliced into that template's #content slot. `positioned` is
     always false for this window (see OptionWindow.h's own model comment): it opens
     screen-centered via window_shell's own .center-both, and the player may drag it by any
     non-control part for the session; no C++-computed position involved.

     Tabs: one .option-tab-row of .option-tab-btn's, each data-class-active-tab="active_tab == N" +
     data-event-click="option_select_tab(N)" -- same data-class-X toggle mechanism
     window_shell.rcss's own data-class-has-title already proves, not a raw data-style override
     (a class toggle avoids the cascade-tie risk a raw style override would carry for a toggled
     visual state). Five .option-tab-panel siblings, one per tab, data-class-hidden="active_tab !=
     N" -- each is itself a flex column (see option_window.rcss's own .option-tab-panel rule), and
     needs the .option-tab-panel.hidden compound-selector override the same file also carries, or
     it would tie with base.rcss's global .hidden{display:none} at equal specificity and silently
     stay visible (window_shell.rcss hit this exact bug for its own header rail first). The tab row
     and all five panels are direct children of this one <body> -- window_shell.rml's #content is a
     single flex-column slot with no way to address more than one region, so tab switching is
     purely a visibility toggle on siblings, not a structural split. The five panels sit in
     .option-tab-scroll, the settings area below the tab row, which scrolls when the window is
     capped to a short screen. The close cross is declared here, in #content, and placed in the
     frame's top-right corner by option_window.rcss. -->
<body template="window_shell" data-model="option_window">
	<div class="paris-options-title">OPCIONES</div>
	<div class="option-tab-row">
		<div class="option-tab-btn" data-class-active-tab="active_tab == 0" data-event-click="option_select_tab(0)">{{tab_display_label}}</div>
		<div class="option-tab-btn" data-class-active-tab="active_tab == 1" data-event-click="option_select_tab(1)">{{tab_graphics_label}}</div>
		<div class="option-tab-btn" data-class-active-tab="active_tab == 2" data-event-click="option_select_tab(2)">{{tab_audio_label}}</div>
		<div class="option-tab-btn" data-class-active-tab="active_tab == 3" data-event-click="option_select_tab(3)">{{tab_gameplay_label}}</div>
		<div class="option-tab-btn" data-class-active-tab="active_tab == 4" data-event-click="option_select_tab(4)">{{tab_interface_label}}</div><div class="option-tab-btn" data-class-active-tab="active_tab == 5" data-event-click="option_select_tab(5)">Clima</div><div class="option-tab-btn" data-class-active-tab="active_tab == 6" data-event-click="option_select_tab(6)">Shaders</div>
	</div>

	<div class="option-close-btn" data-event-click="option_click_close"><span>×</span></div>

	<div class="option-tab-scroll scroll-pane">
<div class="paris-weather-panel" data-class-hidden="active_tab != 6"><div class="weather-section-title">Calidad de Efecto Paris</div><div class="weather-quality-row"><div class="weather-quality" data-class-selected="weather_quality == 0" data-event-click="weather_quality_select(0)"><span>Clásico</span></div><div class="weather-quality" data-class-selected="weather_quality == 1" data-event-click="weather_quality_select(1)"><span>Moderno</span></div><div class="weather-quality" data-class-selected="weather_quality == 2" data-event-click="weather_quality_select(2)"><span>Ultra HD</span></div></div><div class="weather-help">Clasico desactiva los efectos Paris Project. Moderno aplica color suave; Ultra HD aplica el color Paris Project completo. Cada efecto se puede activar por separado.</div><div class="weather-section-title">Efectos Paris Project</div><div class="weather-setting-row"><div class="weather-toggle" data-event-click="weather_toggle(10)"><div class="weather-checkbox" data-class-checked="weather_sky"><span data-if="weather_sky">&#10003;</span></div><span class="weather-setting-label">Cielo Paris Project</span></div></div><div class="weather-setting-row"><div class="weather-toggle" data-event-click="weather_toggle(6)"><div class="weather-checkbox" data-class-checked="weather_natural"><span data-if="weather_natural">&#10003;</span></div><span class="weather-setting-label">Color Paris Project</span></div></div><div class="weather-setting-row"><div class="weather-toggle" data-event-click="weather_toggle(11)"><div class="weather-checkbox" data-class-checked="weather_bloom_enabled"><span data-if="weather_bloom_enabled">&#10003;</span></div><span class="weather-setting-label">Bloom / brillo de luces</span></div></div></div>
<div class="paris-weather-panel" data-class-hidden="active_tab != 5"><div class="weather-section-title">Clima y ciclo del mundo</div><div class="weather-setting-row"><div class="weather-toggle" data-event-click="weather_toggle(0)"><div class="weather-checkbox" data-class-checked="weather_rain"><span data-if="weather_rain">✓</span></div><span class="weather-setting-label">Lluvia</span></div><div class="weather-duration"><div class="weather-step weather-minus" data-event-click="weather_duration(0, -1)">‹</div><span class="weather-duration-value">{{weather_rain_minutes}} min</span><div class="weather-step weather-plus" data-event-click="weather_duration(0, 1)">›</div></div></div><div class="weather-setting-row"><div class="weather-toggle" data-event-click="weather_toggle(1)"><div class="weather-checkbox" data-class-checked="weather_storm"><span data-if="weather_storm">✓</span></div><span class="weather-setting-label">Tormenta y relámpagos</span></div><div class="weather-duration"><div class="weather-step weather-minus" data-event-click="weather_duration(1, -1)">‹</div><span class="weather-duration-value">{{weather_storm_minutes}} min</span><div class="weather-step weather-plus" data-event-click="weather_duration(1, 1)">›</div></div></div><div class="weather-setting-row"><div class="weather-toggle" data-event-click="weather_toggle(2)"><div class="weather-checkbox" data-class-checked="weather_day"><span data-if="weather_day">✓</span></div><span class="weather-setting-label">Ciclo día / noche</span></div><div class="weather-duration"><div class="weather-step weather-minus" data-event-click="weather_duration(2, -1)">‹</div><span class="weather-duration-value">{{weather_day_minutes}} min</span><div class="weather-step weather-plus" data-event-click="weather_duration(2, 1)">›</div></div></div><div class="weather-setting-row"><div class="weather-toggle" data-event-click="weather_toggle(3)"><div class="weather-checkbox" data-class-checked="weather_snow"><span data-if="weather_snow">✓</span></div><span class="weather-setting-label">Nieve</span></div><div class="weather-duration"><div class="weather-step weather-minus" data-event-click="weather_duration(3, -1)">‹</div><span class="weather-duration-value">{{weather_snow_minutes}} min</span><div class="weather-step weather-plus" data-event-click="weather_duration(3, 1)">›</div></div></div><div class="weather-setting-row"><div class="weather-toggle" data-event-click="weather_toggle(4)"><div class="weather-checkbox" data-class-checked="weather_blizzard"><span data-if="weather_blizzard">✓</span></div><span class="weather-setting-label">Ventisca</span></div><div class="weather-duration"><div class="weather-step weather-minus" data-event-click="weather_duration(4, -1)">‹</div><span class="weather-duration-value">{{weather_blizzard_minutes}} min</span><div class="weather-step weather-plus" data-event-click="weather_duration(4, 1)">›</div></div></div><div class="weather-setting-row"><div class="weather-toggle" data-event-click="weather_toggle(5)"><div class="weather-checkbox" data-class-checked="weather_fog"><span data-if="weather_fog">✓</span></div><span class="weather-setting-label">Niebla</span></div><div class="weather-duration"><div class="weather-step weather-minus" data-event-click="weather_duration(5, -1)">‹</div><span class="weather-duration-value">{{weather_fog_minutes}} min</span><div class="weather-step weather-plus" data-event-click="weather_duration(5, 1)">›</div></div></div><div class="weather-section-title">Efectos adicionales</div><div class="weather-setting-row"><div class="weather-toggle" data-event-click="weather_toggle(6)"><div class="weather-checkbox" data-class-checked="weather_natural"><span data-if="weather_natural">&#10003;</span></div><span class="weather-setting-label">Colores naturales</span></div></div><div class="weather-setting-row"><div class="weather-toggle" data-event-click="weather_toggle(7)"><div class="weather-checkbox" data-class-checked="weather_ambient"><span data-if="weather_ambient">&#10003;</span></div><span class="weather-setting-label">Luz de ambiente</span></div></div><div class="weather-setting-row"><div class="weather-toggle" data-event-click="weather_toggle(8)"><div class="weather-checkbox" data-class-checked="weather_stars"><span data-if="weather_stars">&#10003;</span></div><span class="weather-setting-label">Estrellas nocturnas</span></div></div><div class="weather-setting-row"><div class="weather-toggle" data-event-click="weather_toggle(9)"><div class="weather-checkbox" data-class-checked="weather_distance"><span data-if="weather_distance">&#10003;</span></div><span class="weather-setting-label">Niebla de distancia</span></div></div><div class="weather-setting-row"><span class="weather-setting-label weather-slider-label">Nitidez</span><div class="weather-duration"><div class="weather-step weather-minus" data-event-click="weather_adjust(0, -1)">−</div><span class="weather-duration-value">{{weather_sharpness}}%</span><div class="weather-step weather-plus" data-event-click="weather_adjust(0, 1)">+</div></div></div><div class="weather-setting-row"><span class="weather-setting-label weather-slider-label">Intensidad de niebla</span><div class="weather-duration"><div class="weather-step weather-minus" data-event-click="weather_adjust(1, -1)">−</div><span class="weather-duration-value">{{weather_fog_density}}%</span><div class="weather-step weather-plus" data-event-click="weather_adjust(1, 1)">+</div></div></div><div class="weather-setting-row"><span class="weather-setting-label weather-slider-label">Bloom adicional</span><div class="weather-duration"><div class="weather-step weather-minus" data-event-click="weather_adjust(2, -1)">−</div><span class="weather-duration-value">{{weather_bloom}}%</span><div class="weather-step weather-plus" data-event-click="weather_adjust(2, 1)">+</div></div></div><div class="weather-setting-row"><span class="weather-setting-label weather-slider-label">Atmósfera / cielo</span><div class="weather-duration"><div class="weather-step weather-minus" data-event-click="weather_adjust(3, -1)">−</div><span class="weather-duration-value">{{weather_atmosphere}}%</span><div class="weather-step weather-plus" data-event-click="weather_adjust(3, 1)">+</div></div></div><div class="weather-help">Nitidez, colores y bloom requieren efectos de imagen activados en Gráficos.</div><div class="weather-help">Duración: 1, 5, 15, 30, 60 o 120 min.<br/>Día/noche: duración del ciclo completo.<br/>Los audios usan el volumen de Sonido.</div></div>
	<div class="option-tab-panel" data-class-hidden="active_tab != 0">
		<!-- Custom dropdown, not RmlUi's native <select>/<option> -- that was tried first and never
		     reliably worked in this engine: WidgetDropDown's own generated
		     selectvalue/selectbox/selectarrow sub-elements need CSS this theme never fully gave
		     them, and even once styled, option clicks still didn't reliably reach this window's
		     change callback. Reuses the exact mechanism the tab bar above already proves reliable:
		     .option-dropdown-value toggles open/closed (data-event-click="option_toggle_dropdown(N)",
		     N identifying which dropdown -- see OptionWindow.h's model.openDropdown comment for the
		     id scheme), .option-dropdown-list is a data-class-hidden sibling (NOT a child of
		     .option-dropdown-value, so clicking an option doesn't also bubble into the toggle
		     handler), and each data-for-generated .option-dropdown-option calls
		     option_dropdown_option_click(N, it_index) on click. Same shape reused below for FPS
		     Limit/Anti-aliasing/Anisotropic filtering/UI Theme/UI Scale/Language/Font. -->
		<div class="option-row option-select-row">
			<span class="option-row-label">{{resolution_row_label}}</span>
			<div class="option-dropdown">
				<div class="option-dropdown-value" data-event-click="option_toggle_dropdown(0)">{{resolution_value_label}}</div>
				<div class="option-dropdown-list" data-class-hidden="open_dropdown != 0">
					<div class="option-dropdown-option" data-for="label : resolution_labels"
					     data-class-selected="it_index == resolution_index"
					     data-event-click="option_dropdown_option_click(0, it_index)">{{label}}</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="option-row option-checkbox-row" data-event-click="option_toggle_windowed_mode">
			<span class="option-row-label">{{windowed_mode_label}}</span>
			<div class="checkbox-box" data-class-checked="windowed_mode">
				<div class="checkbox-tick">✓</div>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="option-row option-checkbox-row" data-event-click="option_toggle_vsync">
			<span class="option-row-label">{{vsync_label}}</span>
			<div class="checkbox-box" data-class-checked="vsync_enabled">
				<div class="checkbox-tick">✓</div>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="option-row option-select-row">
			<span class="option-row-label">{{fps_cap_row_label}}</span>
			<div class="option-dropdown">
				<div class="option-dropdown-value" data-event-click="option_toggle_dropdown(1)">{{fps_cap_value_label}}</div>
				<div class="option-dropdown-list" data-class-hidden="open_dropdown != 1">
					<div class="option-dropdown-option" data-for="label : fps_cap_labels"
					     data-class-selected="it_index == fps_cap_index"
					     data-event-click="option_dropdown_option_click(1, it_index)">{{label}}</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
		<!-- UI Scale -- this row's label can't say what the percentage multiplies, so the row carries
		     a hint. -->
		<div class="option-row option-select-row option-row-tipped option-opens-up" data-attr-data-hint="ui_scale_tooltip">
			<span class="option-row-label">{{ui_scale_row_label}}</span>
			<div class="option-dropdown">
				<div class="option-dropdown-value" data-event-click="option_toggle_dropdown(5)">{{ui_scale_value_label}}</div>
				<div class="option-dropdown-list" data-class-hidden="open_dropdown != 5">
					<div class="option-dropdown-option" data-for="label : ui_scale_labels"
					     data-class-selected="it_index == ui_scale_index"
					     data-event-click="option_dropdown_option_click(5, it_index)">{{label}}</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>

	<div class="option-tab-panel" data-class-hidden="active_tab != 1">
		<div class="option-section">{{section_quality_label}}</div>
		<div class="option-row option-checkbox-row" data-event-click="option_toggle_enhanced_graphics">
			<span class="option-row-label">{{enhanced_graphics_label}}</span>
			<div class="checkbox-box" data-class-checked="enhanced_graphics">
				<div class="checkbox-tick">✓</div>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="option-row option-checkbox-row option-sub-row" data-class-locked="look_features_locked" data-event-click="option_toggle_enhanced_feature(0)">
			<span class="option-row-label">{{look_lighting_label}}</span>
			<div class="checkbox-box" data-class-checked="look_lighting">
				<div class="checkbox-tick">✓</div>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="option-row option-checkbox-row option-sub-row" data-class-locked="look_dynamic_lights_locked" data-event-click="option_toggle_enhanced_feature(1)">
			<span class="option-row-label">{{look_dynamic_lights_label}}</span>
			<div class="checkbox-box" data-class-checked="look_dynamic_lights">
				<div class="checkbox-tick">✓</div>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="option-row option-checkbox-row option-sub-row" data-class-locked="look_features_locked" data-event-click="option_toggle_enhanced_feature(2)">
			<span class="option-row-label">{{look_light_mood_label}}</span>
			<div class="checkbox-box" data-class-checked="look_light_mood">
				<div class="checkbox-tick">✓</div>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="option-row option-checkbox-row option-sub-row" data-class-locked="look_features_locked" data-event-click="option_toggle_enhanced_feature(3)">
			<span class="option-row-label">{{look_post_processing_label}}</span>
			<div class="checkbox-box" data-class-checked="look_post_processing">
				<div class="checkbox-tick">✓</div>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="option-row option-select-row option-row-tipped" data-attr-data-hint="antialiasing_tooltip">
			<span class="option-row-label">{{antialiasing_row_label}}</span>
			<div class="option-dropdown">
				<div class="option-dropdown-value" data-event-click="option_toggle_dropdown(6)">{{antialiasing_value_label}}</div>
				<div class="option-dropdown-list" data-class-hidden="open_dropdown != 6">
					<div class="option-dropdown-option" data-for="label : antialiasing_labels"
					     data-class-selected="it_index == antialiasing_index"
					     data-event-click="option_dropdown_option_click(6, it_index)">{{label}}</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="option-row option-select-row option-row-tipped" data-attr-data-hint="anisotropy_tooltip">
			<span class="option-row-label">{{anisotropy_row_label}}</span>
			<div class="option-dropdown">
				<div class="option-dropdown-value" data-event-click="option_toggle_dropdown(7)">{{anisotropy_value_label}}</div>
				<div class="option-dropdown-list" data-class-hidden="open_dropdown != 7">
					<div class="option-dropdown-option" data-for="label : anisotropy_labels"
					     data-class-selected="it_index == anisotropy_index"
					     data-event-click="option_dropdown_option_click(7, it_index)">{{label}}</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="option-row option-gauge-row">
			<span class="option-row-label">{{render_level_label}}</span>
			<div class="level-gauge option-gauge effect-gauge">
				<div data-attr-class="'level-gauge-fill level-' + (render_level + 1)"></div>
				<div class="level-gauge-hit option-gauge-hit" data-event-mousedown="option_gauge(2)"
				     data-event-drag="option_gauge(2)" data-event-mousescroll="option_gauge(2)"></div>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="option-section">{{section_effects_label}}</div>
		<div class="option-row option-checkbox-row" data-event-click="option_toggle_render_all_effects">
			<span class="option-row-label">{{render_all_effects_label}}</span>
			<div class="checkbox-box" data-class-checked="render_all_effects">
				<div class="checkbox-tick">✓</div>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="option-row option-checkbox-row" data-event-click="option_toggle_disable_effects">
			<span class="option-row-label">{{disable_effects_label}}</span>
			<div class="checkbox-box" data-class-checked="disable_effects">
				<div class="checkbox-tick">✓</div>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="option-row option-checkbox-row" data-event-click="option_toggle_disable_particles">
			<span class="option-row-label">{{disable_particles_label}}</span>
			<div class="checkbox-box" data-class-checked="disable_particles">
				<div class="checkbox-tick">✓</div>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="option-row option-checkbox-row" data-class-locked="skill_effect_models_locked" data-event-click="option_toggle_disable_skill_effect_models">
			<span class="option-row-label">{{disable_skill_effect_models_label}}</span>
			<div class="checkbox-box" data-class-checked="disable_skill_effect_models">
				<div class="checkbox-tick">✓</div>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="option-row option-checkbox-row" data-class-locked="boids_locked" data-event-click="option_toggle_disable_boids">
			<span class="option-row-label">{{disable_boids_label}}</span>
			<div class="checkbox-box" data-class-checked="disable_boids">
				<div class="checkbox-tick">✓</div>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="option-section">{{section_shadows_label}}</div>
		<div class="option-row option-checkbox-row" data-class-locked="body_shadows_locked" data-event-click="option_toggle_disable_body_shadows">
			<span class="option-row-label">{{disable_body_shadows_label}}</span>
			<div class="checkbox-box" data-class-checked="disable_body_shadows">
				<div class="checkbox-tick">✓</div>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="option-row option-checkbox-row" data-class-locked="wing_shadow_locked" data-event-click="option_toggle_disable_wing_shadow">
			<span class="option-row-label">{{disable_wing_shadow_label}}</span>
			<div class="checkbox-box" data-class-checked="disable_wing_shadow">
				<div class="checkbox-tick">✓</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>

	<div class="option-tab-panel" data-class-hidden="active_tab != 2">
		<div class="option-row option-gauge-row">
			<span class="option-row-label">{{sound_volume_label}}</span>
			<div class="level-gauge option-gauge">
				<div data-attr-class="'level-gauge-fill level-' + sound_volume"></div>
				<div class="level-gauge-hit option-gauge-hit" data-event-mousedown="option_gauge(0)"
				     data-event-drag="option_gauge(0)" data-event-mousescroll="option_gauge(0)"></div>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="option-row option-gauge-row">
			<span class="option-row-label">{{music_volume_label}}</span>
			<div class="level-gauge option-gauge">
				<div data-attr-class="'level-gauge-fill level-' + music_volume"></div>
				<div class="level-gauge-hit option-gauge-hit" data-event-mousedown="option_gauge(1)"
				     data-event-drag="option_gauge(1)" data-event-mousescroll="option_gauge(1)"></div>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="option-row option-checkbox-row" data-event-click="option_toggle_whisper_sound">
			<span class="option-row-label">{{whisper_sound_label}}</span>
			<div class="checkbox-box" data-class-checked="whisper_sound">
				<div class="checkbox-tick">✓</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>

	<div class="option-tab-panel" data-class-hidden="active_tab != 3">
		<div class="option-row option-checkbox-row" data-event-click="option_toggle_player_hp"><span class="option-row-label">Mostrar HP de jugadores</span><div class="checkbox-box" data-class-checked="show_player_hp"><div class="checkbox-tick">✓</div></div></div>
<div class="option-row option-checkbox-row" data-event-click="option_toggle_monster_hp"><span class="option-row-label">Mostrar HP de monstruos</span><div class="checkbox-box" data-class-checked="show_monster_hp"><div class="checkbox-tick">✓</div></div></div>
<div class="option-row option-checkbox-row" data-event-click="option_toggle_hide_names"><span class="option-row-label">Ocultar nombres</span><div class="checkbox-box" data-class-checked="hide_player_names"><div class="checkbox-tick">✓</div></div></div>
<div class="option-row option-checkbox-row" data-event-click="option_toggle_auto_attack">
			<span class="option-row-label">{{auto_attack_label}}</span>
			<div class="checkbox-box" data-class-checked="auto_attack">
				<div class="checkbox-tick">✓</div>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="option-row option-checkbox-row" data-event-click="option_toggle_slide_help">
			<span class="option-row-label">{{slide_help_label}}</span>
			<div class="checkbox-box" data-class-checked="slide_help">
				<div class="checkbox-tick">✓</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>

	<div class="option-tab-panel" data-class-hidden="active_tab != 4">
		<div class="option-row option-select-row">
			<span class="option-row-label">{{language_row_label}}</span>
			<div class="option-dropdown">
				<div class="option-dropdown-value" data-event-click="option_toggle_dropdown(3)">{{language_value_label}}</div>
				<div class="option-dropdown-list" data-class-hidden="open_dropdown != 3">
					<div class="option-dropdown-option" data-for="label : language_labels"
					     data-class-selected="it_index == language_index"
					     data-event-click="option_dropdown_option_click(3, it_index)">{{label}}</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="option-row option-select-row">
			<span class="option-row-label">{{font_row_label}}</span>
			<div class="option-dropdown">
				<div class="option-dropdown-value" data-event-click="option_toggle_dropdown(4)">{{font_value_label}}</div>
				<div class="option-dropdown-list" data-class-hidden="open_dropdown != 4">
					<div class="option-dropdown-option" data-for="label : font_labels"
					     data-class-selected="it_index == font_index"
					     data-event-click="option_dropdown_option_click(4, it_index)">{{label}}</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="option-row option-select-row">
			<span class="option-row-label">{{theme_row_label}}</span>
			<div class="option-dropdown">
				<div class="option-dropdown-value" data-event-click="option_toggle_dropdown(2)">{{theme_value_label}}</div>
				<div class="option-dropdown-list" data-class-hidden="open_dropdown != 2">
					<div class="option-dropdown-option" data-for="label : theme_labels"
					     data-class-selected="it_index == theme_index"
					     data-event-click="option_dropdown_option_click(2, it_index)">{{label}}</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
		<!-- Show FPS Counter/Show Debug Info are mutually exclusive (SceneManager.h enforces it
		     internally) -- ticking one visually unticks the other on its own next sync, no extra
		     markup needed here for that. -->
		<div class="option-row option-checkbox-row" data-event-click="option_toggle_show_fps_counter">
			<span class="option-row-label">{{show_fps_counter_label}}</span>
			<div class="checkbox-box" data-class-checked="show_fps_counter">
				<div class="checkbox-tick">✓</div>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="option-row option-checkbox-row" data-event-click="option_toggle_show_debug_info">
			<span class="option-row-label">{{show_debug_info_label}}</span>
			<div class="checkbox-box" data-class-checked="show_debug_info">
				<div class="checkbox-tick">✓</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
	</div>
</body>
</rml>
